{"unit_id": "tag:008R:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是一个连续映射（map）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的环（rings）的预层（presheaf），并设<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>上的环（rings）的预层（presheaf）。至此，我们已定义了函子（functors）\n<MATH_0006>\n这些函子满足如下相容关系。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "给定的连续映射"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "第一个预层所取的对象"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "第一个空间上的预层"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "第二个预层所取的对象"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "第二个空间上的预层"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "到此为止已经定义的构造"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:008U:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是拓扑空间（topological spaces）之间的连续映射（map）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的环（rings）的预层（presheaf）。设<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>-模（modules）的预层（presheaf）。设<MATH_0006>是<MATH_0007>-模（modules）的预层（presheaf）。则\n<MATH_0008>\n这里使用了引理<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>，并将<MATH_0009>视为<MATH_0010>-模（module），其结构由映射（map）\n<MATH_0011>\n给出（该映射最先在引理<REF_0003>的证明中定义）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "连续映射的定义域和陪域"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "给定的连续映射"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "预层所取的代数对象"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "给定的环预层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "第一个模预层所取的模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "第一个给定的模预层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "第二个模预层所取的模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "第二个给定的模预层"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "借助指定映射得到的模"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "用来赋予模结构的映射"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:008U:proof", "translation": "注意，我们有\n<MATH_0001>\n这见于第<REF_0001>节。因此，需要证明的是，在这一对应（correspondence）下，由模（module）映射（maps）组成的子集（subsets）彼此对应。此外，这一对应（correspondence）由规则\n<MATH_0002>\n决定，反方向则由规则\n<MATH_0003>\n决定，其中<MATH_0004>和<MATH_0005>如第<REF_0002>节所述。因此，利用<MATH_0006>和<MATH_0007>的函子性（functoriality），可知只需验证映射（maps）\n<MATH_0008>和\n<MATH_0009>\n与模（module）结构相容。这留给读者验证。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "correspondence", "target_term": "对应"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "subsets", "target_term": "子集"}, {"source_term": "correspondence", "target_term": "对应"}, {"source_term": "functoriality", "target_term": "函子性"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "correspondence", "target_term": "对应", "context": "所引章节给出的对应"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "对子集中所含映射的结构要求"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "构成两个子集的映射"}, {"source_term": "subsets", "target_term": "子集", "context": "由模映射组成的两个子集"}, {"source_term": "correspondence", "target_term": "对应", "context": "由两条规则刻画的对应"}, {"source_term": "functoriality", "target_term": "函子性", "context": "用以化简验证的性质"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "需要验证与结构相容的映射"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "映射需要保持的结构"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:008V:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是拓扑空间（topological spaces）之间的连续映射（map）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的环（rings）的预层（presheaf）。设<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>-模（modules）的预层（presheaf）。设<MATH_0006>是<MATH_0007>-模（modules）的预层（presheaf）。则\n<MATH_0008>\n这里使用了引理<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>，并且在定义张量积（tensor product）时使用了映射（map）<MATH_0009>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "tensor product", "target_term": "张量积"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "连续映射的定义域和陪域"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "给定的连续映射"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "预层所取的代数对象"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "给定的环预层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "第一个模预层所取的模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "第一个给定的模预层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "第二个模预层所取的模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "第二个给定的模预层"}, {"source_term": "tensor product", "target_term": "张量积", "context": "等式中采用的代数构造"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "定义张量积所用的映射"}], "notes": []}
