{"unit_id": "tag:008R:prose-0004", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是一个连续映射（map）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的（预）环层（sheaf of rings），并设<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>上的（预）环层（sheaf of rings）。至此，我们已定义了函子（functors）\n<MATH_0006>\n显然，这对函子（functors）<MATH_0007>作用于模（modules）的层（sheaves），通常并不互为伴随（adjoint），因为它们的目标范畴（categories）并不匹配。也就是说，如上所见，只有环层（sheaves of rings）<MATH_0008>极为巧合地满足关系（relations）<MATH_0009>和<MATH_0010>时才行。实际上，这种情况几乎从不发生。我们暂且中断讨论，给出恰当的态射（morphism）概念，使得在模（modules）的层（sheaves）上存在一对适当的伴随（adjoint）函子（functors）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "adjoint", "target_term": "伴随"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "sheaves of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "relations", "target_term": "关系"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "adjoint", "target_term": "伴随"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "给定的连续映射"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层", "context": "第一个空间上的环层或环预层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层", "context": "第二个空间上的环层或环预层"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "到此为止已经定义的构造"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "正在讨论是否互为伴随的一对函子"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "所论函子的作用对象所涉及的模"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "所论函子的作用对象所涉及的层"}, {"source_term": "adjoint", "target_term": "伴随", "context": "这对