{"unit_id": "tag:0090:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是拓扑空间（topological space），<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的环层（sheaf of rings）。这里应把环层（sheaf of rings）<MATH_0004>看作<MATH_0005>上的函数（functions）的层（sheaf）。如果<MATH_0006>是一个“适当的”映射（map），那么通过复合（composition），<MATH_0007>上的函数（function）就变为<MATH_0008>上的函数（function）。因此，应当有一个自然的<MATH_0009>-映射（map），从<MATH_0010>到<MATH_0011>，见定义<REF_0001>和引理<REF_0002>。一个具体的例子见下文的例<REF_0003>。下面给出相应的抽象定义。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "functions", "target_term": "函数"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "环层所在的底空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层", "context": "给定的取值为环的层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层", "context": "要视为函数层的环层"}, {"source_term": "functions", "target_term": "函数", "context": "用来理解给定环层的函数"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "由函数构成的层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "用来复合函数的适当映射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "经由适当映射转化函数的操作"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数", "context": "复合前的函数"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数", "context": "复合后的函数"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "由复合得到的自然映射"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0091:statement", "translation": "<TEXTITOPEN_0001>赋环空间（ringed space）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是一个二元组（pair）<MATH_0001>，由拓扑空间（topological space）<MATH_0002>和环层（sheaf of rings）<MATH_0003>组成，后者定义在<MATH_0004>上。<TEXTITOPEN_0002>赋环空间的态射（morphism of ringed spaces）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002><MATH_0005>是一个二元组（pair），由连续映射（map）<MATH_0006>和环层（sheaves of rings）之间的一个<MATH_0007>-映射（map）\n<MATH_0008>\n组成。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ringed space", "target_term": "赋环空间"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "morphism of ringed spaces", "target_term": "赋环空间的态射"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "sheaves of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "ringed space", "target_term": "赋环空间", "context": "由拓扑空间及其环层组成的对象"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组", "context": "赋环空间的两个组成部分"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "赋环空间的底空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层", "context": "赋环空间的层部分"}, {"source_term": "morphism of ringed spaces", "target_term": "赋环空间的态射", "context": "本定义引入的态射"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组", "context": "赋环空间态射的两个组成部分"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "态射在底空间上的连续映射"}, {"source_term": "sheaves of rings", "target_term": "环层", "context": "态射的第二个组成部分所涉及的层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "态射的环层部分"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0092:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是拓扑空间（topological spaces）之间的连续映射（map）。考虑由连续实值（real valued）函数（functions）构成的层（sheaves），即<MATH_0002>（定义在<MATH_0003>上）和<MATH_0004>（定义在<MATH_0005>上），见例<REF_0001>。我们断言，存在一个自然的<MATH_0006>-映射（map）<MATH_0007>，与<MATH_0008>相关联。具体来说，直接按如下规则定义它：\n<MATH_0009>\n严格地说，应写成<MATH_0010>。显然，这是定义<REF_0002>所述的映射（maps）族（family），并与<MATH_0011>-代数（algebra）结构相容。因此，它是一个<MATH_0012>-映射（map），作用于<MATH_0013>-代数（algebras）的层（sheaves）之间，见引理<REF_0003>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n当然，在许多其他情形中，某类几何态射（morphism）也对应着赋环空间（ringed spaces）的一个典范态射（canonical morphism）。例如，若<MATH_0014>、<MATH_0015>是<MATH_0016>-流形（manifolds），且<MATH_0017>是无穷可微（infinitely differentiable）的映射（map），则<MATH_0018>诱导赋环空间（ringed spaces）的典范态射（canonical morphism）\n<MATH_0019>。\n这个构造（与上面的构造完全相同）留给读者完成。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "real valued", "target_term": "实值"}, {"source_term": "functions", "target_term": "函数"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "ringed spaces", "target_term": "赋环空间"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "manifolds", "target_term": "流形"}, {"source_term": "infinitely differentiable", "target_term": "无穷可微"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "ringed spaces", "target_term": "赋环空间"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "连续映射的定义域和陪域"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "例中给定的连续映射"}, {"source_term": "real valued", "target_term": "实值", "context": "函数的取值范围"}, {"source_term": "functions", "target_term": "函数", "context": "构成所述两层的连续实值函数"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "两个空间上的函数层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "与给定连续映射相关联的映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "组成定义中所述的族的映射"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族", "context": "由定义中所述映射组成的族"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "映射族相容的结构"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "所得的层之间的映射"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所得映射涉及的层所取的对象"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "所得映射涉及的代数层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "可给出赋环空间态射的几何态射"}, {"source_term": "ringed spaces", "target_term": "赋环空间", "context": "相关典范态射所在的空间"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "与几何态射相关联的态射"}, {"source_term": "manifolds", "target_term": "流形", "context": "例中无穷可微映射的定义域和陪域"}, {"source_term": "infinitely differentiable", "target_term": "无穷可微", "context": "流形间映射的光滑性条件"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "诱导典范态射的无穷可微映射"}, {"source_term": "ringed spaces", "target_term": "赋环空间", "context": "所诱导的典范态射涉及的空间"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "由无穷可微映射诱导的态射"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0090:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n如何将赋环空间（ringed spaces）的态射（morphisms）复合（compose）起来，可能并不完全显然，因此这里详细写出做法。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ringed spaces", "target_term": "赋环空间"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "compose", "target_term": "复合"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "ringed spaces", "target_term": "赋环空间", "context": "待复合的态射所涉及的空间"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "需要描述如何复合的态射"}, {"source_term": "compose", "target_term": "复合", "context": "将两个态射接在一起的操作"}], "notes": []}
