{"unit_id": "tag:0094:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们已经引入了足够的记号（notation），现在可以定义模（modules）沿赋环空间的态射（morphism of ringed spaces）的拉回（pullback）和推出（pushforward）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "notation", "target_term": "记号"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "morphism of ringed spaces", "target_term": "赋环空间的态射"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "pushforward", "target_term": "推出"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "notation", "target_term": "记号", "context": "前面已引入的数学记号"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "所定义构造作用的代数对象"}, {"source_term": "morphism of ringed spaces", "target_term": "赋环空间的态射", "context": "沿其构造拉回和推出的态射"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "沿态射反向作用于模的构造"}, {"source_term": "pushforward", "target_term": "推出", "context": "沿态射正向作用于模的构造"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0095:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是赋环空间的态射（morphism of ringed spaces）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>-模（modules）的层（sheaf）。我们将<TEXTITOPEN_0001>推出（pushforward）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>作用于<MATH_0004>所得的对象定义为这样一个<MATH_0005>-模（modules）的层（sheaf）：它作为阿贝尔群（abelian groups）的层（sheaf）等于<MATH_0006>，其模（module）结构是沿<MATH_0007>对引理<REF_0001>给出的模（module）结构作限制（restriction）而得的。\n<STRUCT_0003> 设<MATH_0008>是<MATH_0009>-模（modules）的层（sheaf）。我们定义<TEXTITOPEN_0002>拉回（pullback）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002><MATH_0010>为由下列公式（formula）给出的<MATH_0011>-模（modules）的层（sheaf）：\n<MATH_0012>\n其中，环映射（ring map）<MATH_0013>是与<MATH_0014>对应的映射（map），模（module）结构由引理<REF_0002>给出。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism of ringed spaces", "target_term": "赋环空间的态射"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "pushforward", "target_term": "推出"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "formula", "target_term": "公式"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism of ringed spaces", "target_term": "赋环空间的态射", "context": "给定的赋环空间态射"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "推出的输入层所取的模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "给定的推出输入"}, {"source_term": "pushforward", "target_term": "推出", "context": "第一项所定义的构造"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "推出所得层所取的模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "推出所得的模层"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "描述底层对象时层所取的对象"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "推出的底层阿贝尔群层"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "推出所得层上的额外结构"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "限制前由所引引理给出的结构"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "context": "通过指定映射得到推出模结构的操作"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "拉回的输入层所取的模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "给定的拉回输入"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "第二项所定义的构造"}, {"source_term": "formula", "target_term": "公式", "context": "给出拉回层的公式"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "拉回所得层所取的模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "拉回所得的模层"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "公式用到的环层之间的映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "与指定对象对应的映射"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "拉回所得层上由引理给出的结构"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0094:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这样，我们就定义了函子（functors）\n<MATH_0001>\n关于这些函子（functors）的最后一个结果是，它们确实如预期那样互为伴随（adjoint）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "adjoint", "target_term": "伴随"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "刚定义的两个函子"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "最后一个结果所涉及的两个函子"}, {"source_term": "adjoint", "target_term": "伴随", "context": "两个函子间的预期关系"}], "notes": []}
